    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871080/extras/eaf77d2c22ea41efecd2486665e75d1b.avif?t=1753673901\" width=600 height=117 /></span><br><br>Welcome to <i>Ashen Wilds</i>\u2014a harsh, post-apocalyptic world full of danger, mystery, and tough choices.<br>Whether you play solo or with friends, your main goal is simple: <strong>survive</strong>. But getting there? Not so easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this open world survival game, you\u2019ll need to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather resources</strong> like wood, food, and metals to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft tools, weapons, and gear</strong> to defend yourself and expand your base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your own fortress</strong> to protect yourself from the wild\u2014and from other survivors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight terrifying creatures</strong>, especially dangerous at night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounter other players</strong>\u2014but beware: not everyone is friendly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you create your own story or team up with others, your choices will shape your fate in <i>Ashen Wilds</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Deep crafting system</strong> \u2013 from simple tools to high-tech defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Custom base building</strong> \u2013 design and fortify your base the way you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Dangerous PvPvE environment</strong> \u2013 battle against creatures and rival survivors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Dynamic open world</strong> \u2013 including weather effects, day/night cycle, and hidden locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Co-op and PvP gameplay</strong> \u2013 go solo, team up, or compete against others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd13 <strong>Unlockable skills &amp; gear</strong> \u2013 progress and improve as you survive.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871080/extras/eaf77d2c22ea41efecd2486665e75d1b.avif?t=1753673901\" width=600 height=117 /></span><br><br>Welcome to <i>Ashen Wilds</i>\u2014a harsh, post-apocalyptic world full of danger, mystery, and tough choices.<br>Whether you play solo or with friends, your main goal is simple: <strong>survive</strong>. But getting there? Not so easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this open world survival game, you\u2019ll need to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather resources</strong> like wood, food, and metals to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft tools, weapons, and gear</strong> to defend yourself and expand your base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your own fortress</strong> to protect yourself from the wild\u2014and from other survivors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight terrifying creatures</strong>, especially dangerous at night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounter other players</strong>\u2014but beware: not everyone is friendly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you create your own story or team up with others, your choices will shape your fate in <i>Ashen Wilds</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Deep crafting system</strong> \u2013 from simple tools to high-tech defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Custom base building</strong> \u2013 design and fortify your base the way you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Dangerous PvPvE environment</strong> \u2013 battle against creatures and rival survivors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Dynamic open world</strong> \u2013 including weather effects, day/night cycle, and hidden locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Co-op and PvP gameplay</strong> \u2013 go solo, team up, or compete against others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd13 <strong>Unlockable skills &amp; gear</strong> \u2013 progress and improve as you survive.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Ashen Wilds is a challenging survival experience in a brutal open world. Gather resources, build your base, and protect yourself from deadly creatures\u2014and other survivors. Trust no one.",
